<title>USA: Sykes Enterprises completes merger.</title>
<headline>Sykes Enterprises completes merger.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sykes Enterprises Inc said Monday it has completed its merger with Info Systems of North Carolina Inc.</p>
<p>In connection with the tax-free, stock-for-stock transaction, the company issued about 1.1 million shares, on a post three-for-two stock split basis, of its common stock in exchange for all the outstanding common shares of privately held Info Systems.</p>
<p>The total value of the transaction was not disclosed.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
